.DS_Store
# Do NOT ignore deploy/ or scripts/. The dagster image
# (deploy/dagster/Dockerfile.dagster) does `COPY . /app`, and its daemon and
# webservers load deploy/dagster/workspace.yaml from it at runtime. The assets once
# shelled out to a deploy script under scripts/ as well, and an image without it failed
# every asset; nothing there is shelled out to now, but keep scripts/ in the context.
